{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to schedule a consultation, ask about blends, or learn which aromatic approach may support you.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fff7f2; --ink:#2b1f1a; --accent:#ff7a59; --muted:#6b5a52; --card:#fff9f7; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial; color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    header{padding:28px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ffb38a);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}

    .hero{padding:36px 20px 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--card));padding:22px;border-radius:18px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(43,31,26,0.08)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:20px}
    .hero p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}

    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;padding:20px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
    .left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(43,31,26,0.06)}
    h2{margin:0 0 8px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-grid{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood-btn{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,31,26,0.06);background:white;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .mood-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff 0%,#fff5f2 100%);border-color:rgba(255,122,89,0.2);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(255,122,89,0.08)}
    .method-output{margin-top:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),#fff);}
    .method-output h3{margin:0 0 6px}
    .method-output p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .toggle-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .switch{width:56px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:#eee;padding:3px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
    .knob{width:22px;height:22px;background:white;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(43,31,26,0.08);transform:translateX(0);transition:transform 320ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .switch.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffb38a)}
    .price-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .price-card{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff);text-align:center}
    .price{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);transition:all 420ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .sm{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    input,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,31,26,0.08);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{padding:28px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    @media(max-width:880px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:22px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">A</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Backstory</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book a Session</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 800 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff1ec"/>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff9f7"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <rect width="800" height="400" fill="url(#g)"/>
      <g opacity="0.12" fill="#ff7a59">
        <circle cx="60" cy="40" r="80"/>
        <circle cx="740" cy="320" r="120"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="hero-card">
      <h1>Let's make something that smells like calm — or focus, or quiet.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Reach out to schedule a consult, request a sample blend, or ask about group sessions that may support relaxation and clarity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="layout">
    <div class="left">
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Quick contact</h2>
        <p class="lead">Prefer email? Use the form or tap the button to open your mail app. We'll reply within 48 hours.</p>
        <form id="contactForm" action="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" method="GET" enctype="text/plain" onsubmit="return submitMail(event)">
          <div class="row">
            <input placeholder="Your name" name="name" required>
            <input placeholder="Phone" name="phone">
          </div>
          <input type="email" placeholder="Email" name="email" required>
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="How can we help? Tell us a little about your needs."></textarea>
          <label class="meta"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required> I consent to receive email about scheduling and services.</label>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Email {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</button>
            <a class="btn" id="ctaDirect" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Mood-to-Method</h2>
        <p class="lead">Pick how you feel. The suggested approach and the action button will adapt to point you to the best next step.</p>
        <div class="mood-grid" role="list">
          <button class="mood-btn" data-key="tense">Tense</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-key="foggy">Foggy</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-key="restless">Restless</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-key="steady">Steady</button>
        </div>

        <div class="method-output" id="methodOutput">
          <h3 id="methodTitle">Choose a mood</h3>
          <p id="methodBody">When you pick a mood, we'll suggest a gentle aromatic approach, a simple at-home method, and an action link to book or learn more.</p>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:8px">Safety note: recommendations are intended to support wellbeing and do not replace medical advice. Always patch test; see FAQ below for pregnancy, pets, and dilution guidance.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Safety & FAQ</h2>
        <p class="meta">Aromatherapy is safety-forward. Please review:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Always dilute essential oils before skin application; typical topicals range from 1–3% for daily adult use.</li>
          <li>Do a patch test before first topical use; stop if irritation occurs.</li>
          <li>Keep oils away from eyes and mucous membranes.</li>
          <li>If pregnant, nursing, or under medical care, consult a provider before use.</li>
          <li>Many essential oils are not safe for cats; research pet safety before diffusing around sensitive animals.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Pricing Comparator</h2>
        <p class="lead">Toggle between Monthly membership pricing and Single-session packages. Numbers animate to show you the difference.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
          <div class="toggle-wrap">
            <span class="sm">Monthly</span>
            <div id="priceSwitch" class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0">
              <div class="knob"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="sm">Package</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sm">Billed as shown</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:10px">
          <div class="price-row">
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="sm">Starter</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="39" data-package="99">$39</div>
              <div class="sm">One-on-one intro</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="sm">Support</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="79" data-package="199">$79</div>
              <div class="sm">Short series / mini-cohort</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="price-row">
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="sm">Deep work</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="149" data-package="399">$149</div>
              <div class="sm">Extended program</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="sm">Group</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="29" data-package="69">$29</div>
              <div class="sm">Per person, per session</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
        <h2>Connect</h2>
        <p class="lead">Call or email to ask about a custom blend, sample, or cohort program.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
          <a class="btn" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email</a>
          <a class="btn" id="bookNow" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong><br>
        <span class="meta">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Small-group cohorts • Custom blends • Cohort schedules updated seasonally</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Mailto helper: collect form values into body and subject
    function submitMail(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const f = e.target;
      const params = [];
      const name = encodeURIComponent(f.name.value || '');
      const email = encodeURIComponent(f.email.value || '');
      const phone = encodeURIComponent(f.phone.value || '');
      const msg = encodeURIComponent(f.message.value || '');
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Inquiry from website: ' + (f.name.value || 'Visitor'));
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+(f.name.value||'')+'\nEmail: '+(f.email.value||'')+'\nPhone: '+(f.phone.value||'')+'\n\nMessage:\n'+(f.message.value||''));
      const href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
      window.location.href = href;
      return false;
    }

    // Mood-to-Method data and behavior
    const methods = {
      tense: {
        title: 'Soothing slow-breath method',
        body: 'A gentle approach: aromatherapy with grounding top notes and a short guided breathing practice. Try a light roll-on (1% dilution) for wrists and a diffuser for short periods. Recommended scent profile: soft wood + citrus may support calm.',
        cta: 'Book a calming consult',
        url: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=tense'
      },
      foggy: {
        title: 'Bright-focus micro ritual',
        body: 'Use uplifting citrus and herbaceous notes in a personal inhaler or 0.5–1% topical application. Small, intentional sniff cycles paired with short tasks can help you reorient. Keep sessions short and ventilated.',
        cta: 'Reserve a clarity session',
        url: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=foggy'
      },
      restless: {
        title: 'Rhythm reset: anchor & unwind',
        body: 'A calming blend with soft floral and resinous anchors used in a diffuser for 10–15 minutes. Pair with a short stretching routine. Consider a 1–2% topical roll-on for pulse points.',
        cta: 'Join a reset cohort',
        url: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=restless'
      },
      steady: {
        title: 'Maintenance ritual',
        body: 'If you are steady, a light daily ritual can support continuity: diffuse once in the morning, or use a sachet. Lower concentrations (0.5–1%) are often enough for ongoing use.',
        cta: 'Explore maintenance plans',
        url: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=steady'
      }
    };

    document.querySelectorAll('.mood-btn').forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        document.querySelectorAll('.mood-btn').forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        const key = btn.dataset.key;
        const data = methods[key];
        document.getElementById('methodTitle').textContent = data.title;
        document.getElementById('methodBody').textContent = data.body;
        // update CTAs
        document.getElementById('ctaDirect').textContent = data.cta;
        document.getElementById('ctaDirect').href = data.url;
        document.getElementById('bookNow').textContent = data.cta;
        document.getElementById('bookNow').href = data.url;
      });
    });

    // Pricing comparator: animate numbers on toggle
    const switchEl = document.getElementById('priceSwitch');
    const knobs = switchEl.querySelector('.knob');
    let isOn = false; // false = Monthly shown, true = Package shown

    function updateSwitchUI(){
      if(isOn){
        switchEl.classList.add('on');
        switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked','true');
        knobs.style.transform = 'translateX(28px)';
      } else {
        switchEl.classList.remove('on');
        switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked','false');
        knobs.style.transform = 'translateX(0)';
      }
      animatePrices();
    }

    switchEl.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ isOn = !isOn; updateSwitchUI(); });
    switchEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); isOn = !isOn; updateSwitchUI(); } });

    function animatePrices(){
      document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(el=>{
        const start = parseInt(el.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || 0;
        const end = parseInt(el.dataset[ isOn ? 'package' : 'month'],10) || 0;
        const sign = end >= start ? 1 : -1;
        const duration = 600;
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function step(t){
          const p = Math.min(1,(t-startTime)/duration);
          const ease = 1 - Math.pow(1-p,3);
          const val = Math.round(start + (end-start)*ease);
          el.textContent = '$' + val;
          if(p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      });
    }

    // initialize prices to monthly values
    document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(el=>{
      el.textContent = '$' + (el.dataset.month);
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the aromatherapy site bundle.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — The Connect page for web visitors. Contains:
  - Contact form that opens mail client with prefilled subject/body (mailto to {{EMAIL}}).
  - Mood-to-Method selector: choose a mood and the recommended approach, copy, and CTAs update dynamically.
  - Pricing Comparator: toggle between Monthly and Package pricing with animated number transitions.
  - Safety & FAQ notes (dilution, patch test, pregnancy, pets).

How to test locally:
1. Save contact.html and open it in a modern browser (Chrome/Firefox/Safari).
2. Click the Mood-to-Method buttons (Tense, Foggy, Restless, Steady) and watch the Recommendation block and CTA buttons update.
3. Use the pricing switch (click or press Enter/Space while focused) to toggle between monthly and package prices. Numbers animate.
4. Submit the contact form to open your mail client (mailto uses {{EMAIL}}).

Placeholders to replace in your deployment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes and accessibility:
- The pricing switch is keyboard operable and uses aria-checked.
- The Mood-to-Method buttons are simple buttons; they change visible copy and CTAs only (no medical claims, safety-forward language included).
- No external fonts or assets are required; layout and visuals are implemented with CSS and inline SVG.

Safety guidance reminder (copy is present in the page): always recommend dilution (1–3% typical topicals for adults), patch test, consult a healthcare provider if pregnant or nursing, and check pet safety (cats especially sensitive).

If you need an assets folder (e.g., unique SVG pattern file assets/img/pattern.svg), add it to the bundle and update references. This chunk intentionally contains only the contact page and README as requested."}
BUNDLE_END
